"id": "276525354504752", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031532_276525357838085_6991066571000915733_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bX9cm4bjJAgQ7kNvwGYbRta&_nc_oc=Adp1ho3k4hLTRHJx5Sj7zyS65Lxm60-DE0nknHU41nmchrCIrbgdpgsyXYUxc1ATErg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTx0Og8-IAMHU-fFeIboEduq2JDceiSfndBFCpviaieHg&oe=6AFC631C"}, "display_name": "Once Upon a Sea - Eli Raz - The Prophet", "keywords": ["Environmental"], "long_description": "\u201cFor millennia, the Jordan River flowed into the Dead Sea undisturbed. Today the Jordan River is a polluted trickle. Industry and mining drain the lowest place on Earth\u2019s water even more. The Dead Sea decline is triggering a catastrophic movement of underground water. As it moves it dissolves deposits under the region\u2019s shores, leaving behind an ever-growing network of dangerous sinkholes.\"", "short_description": "Once Upon a Sea\u2014Eli Raz\u2014The Prophet offers a stark educational journey into the environmental crisis facing the Dead Sea. You'll explore the region's geological history and understand the devastating impact of industrialization and over-extraction on the Jordan River, which is now a mere trickle. The core gameplay involves navigating the landscape to witness firsthand the consequences of receding water levels, including the proliferation of dangerous sinkholes along the shores. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://blimey.tv/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Blimey", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://blimey.tv/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["DOCUMENTARY_HISTORY", "EDUCATIONAL", "TRAVEL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26849626951374155"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031379_613480883223689_2920342678969028985_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t3O4RtVfDrkQ7kNvwF-FEPW&_nc_oc=AdrK9pWEDa9xBGwu0jIoKo-1PeTAQOjmz5wfhfStMB9X3DuMzD85Sk7_Ljm_qjdBmnk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSnWsovClUKWOGGHQ_1X0Ur73fdxTzxrzC0mCFwo_Y7sw&oe=6AFC887B"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Once Upon a Sea - Eli Raz - The Prophet", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Learning", "id": "1043107547362485"}, {"topic_name": "Travel & Exploration", "id": "726368587961803"}], "release_date": 1644535488, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "666475357688598", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "4668463739917127", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "319239756539827"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "OUAS_Landscape.png", "id": "1815036082015070", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572936_1815036085348403_8818759797354385544_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bu